  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Ciencia y Tecnologa II Etapa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science and Technology Program II Stage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WILL DEVELOP AND STRENGTHEN THE COUNTRY&apos;S SCIENTIFIC AND TECHNOLOGICAL CAPACITY, THROUGH THE FOLLOWING COMPONENTS: A) RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT PROJECT FINANCING; B) HUMAN RESOURCE TRAINING; C) STRENGTHENING OF RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT CENTERS; D) PROMOTION OF INNOVATION IN THE PRODUCTIVE, SOCIAL AND ENVIRONMENTAL SECTORS; E) POPULARIZATION OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY; F) INFORMATION SERVICES; AND G) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
